WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
You were quite into video
games when you were growing up.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.253
Yes.

00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:05.086
Were you a gamer?

00:00:05.086 --> 00:00:06.130
I wouldn't call myself a gamer.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.946
I was exclusively obsessed
with the game Zelda

00:00:09.946 --> 00:00:11.740
(audience cheers)

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.610
for super Nintendo,
Right.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.000
the greatest game ever made.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.220
What made that game so great?

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.933
It was pure magic.

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:21.180
Right.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.926
Foolish me.

00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:23.759
You know there're just.

00:00:23.759 --> 00:00:25.530
I was obsessed with boots, boob slap,

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.844
you know, was just like,

00:00:26.844 --> 00:00:27.812
I just

00:00:27.812 --> 00:00:28.890
It was also a little known Nintendo game.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.540
I was never really into the, you know, the

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:32.960
I guess the, the fighting game.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.090
I liked the story games.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.228
It was a great story.

00:00:36.228 --> 00:00:37.395
You know.

00:00:37.395 --> 00:00:38.603
You get nostalgic for those old.

00:00:38.603 --> 00:00:39.436
I do.

00:00:39.436 --> 00:00:40.360
Do you play any new games now?

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.193
Do you ever?

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:42.990
I don't so much now.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.480
I actually have a couple of game systems,

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.100
but I don't, I don't really play now.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.210
When I was 12 though,

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.110
I had the Super Nintendo
I got for Christmas

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:54.039
and I got so obsessed with
Zelda that I realized how

00:00:54.039 --> 00:00:56.590
that I was addicted to playing it.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.643
And I gave my system away,

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.160
because I realized I couldn't, you know,

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.760
that I was spending
hours on hours playing.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:05.593
And.

00:01:05.593 --> 00:01:06.426
So you went cold turkey.

00:01:06.426 --> 00:01:07.328
That was very responsible of you.

00:01:07.328 --> 00:01:08.161
Yeah.

00:01:08.161 --> 00:01:09.103
Most kids don't do that.
Well yeah.

00:01:09.103 --> 00:01:10.180
(Zooey laughs)

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.520
That's what I hear.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:12.353
I have seven year old

00:01:12.353 --> 00:01:14.800
