00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.680
I'm about to get to the dark world."

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.513
You know,
Yeah.

00:01:50.513 --> 00:01:52.618
And it's really upsetting.
It turns.

00:01:52.618 --> 00:01:54.510
